# The Firebase iOS config, the twin of android/app/google-services.json. The iOS template has no
# rule for it at all, so it would be committed the moment it is dropped in. It carries an API_KEY
# field and this repository is public; Google treats that as a client identifier rather than a
# secret, but publishing it is the owner's call to make deliberately rather than by default.
App/App/GoogleService-Info.plist
